<section class="wrap narrow reveal">
  <div class="frame frame--creed">
    <p class="kicker">Closing Stance</p>
    <p>The torus chapter is the framework at its most seductive and therefore at its most dangerous. A
      shape that appears everywhere explains nothing by appearing; it earns its place only where it
      forbids something. The next chapter is where the geometry starts forbidding things &mdash; because
      the Möbius strip, unlike the torus, is not a level but a transition between levels.</p>
    <p class="muted small">Next: <a href="/moebius/">the inside of the outside</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>
